	'k09921af4' => 'Our second-floor clinic provides full accessibility for all visitors. The main building entrance features level, step-free access with automated sliding doors, leading directly to a spacious passenger elevator. Inside the clinic, wide doorways, unobstructed corridors, accessible restrooms, and level consultation rooms accommodate wheelchairs and walking aids. If you require specific assistance upon arrival, our reception staff is ready to help make your visit smooth and comfortable.',
