	'k2cc261a3' => 'Our Clinical Values',
	'k2dab1962' => 'Workplace Assessments',
	'k2f95fcdb' => 'Our structured return-to-work programme helps employees recover from physical strain and resume full workplace duties safely. We combine targeted clinical exercise with gradual workplace adaptation over six weeks.',
	'k31991f6f' => 'Our structured return-to-work programme spans 6 weeks and includes 6 individual sessions for €960. Directed by physiotherapist Ines Moreau, the service supports employees recovering from musculoskeletal conditions such as shoulder or lower back strain. Each stage pairs active rehabilitation exercises with phased increases in job duties. By collaborating with supervisors and adjusting workstation mechanics throughout the 6-week timeframe, we help workers rebuild stamina safely and resume full shifts without suffering setbacks or re-injury.',
