	'kbd385314' => 'Tell us about one job that hurts.',
	'kbe2ebeea' => 'Transparent Service Pricing',
	'kc24f8cce' => 'Priya Natarajan is our audiometry and health-check technician, managing screening rooms at 2F, 41 Foundry Lane. She conducts hearing tests, visual acuity screenings, and physiological measurements during pre-employment and periodic health checks. Priya ensures diagnostic evaluations are accurate, comfortable, and efficient, helping employees understand their baseline health while giving employers reliable documentation for occupational safety compliance.',
	'kc6ef699b' => 'Office &amp; desk ergonomics',
	'kc748fa65' => 'Our annual employer plan costs €4,800 / year for businesses with up to 50 employees. This comprehensive plan provides companies with predictable occupational health coverage, including prioritized employee assessments, routine periodic health checks, and dedicated employer coordination from Tomas Lindqvist. Partnering organizations receive scheduled workstation visits on Tuesdays and Thursdays, rapid clinical advice for emerging physical strain cases, and clear reporting to support health and safety compliance across all departments.',
	'kc94d3fdb' => 'If you prefer to contact us online, please complete our enquiry form with your full name, company name, email address, and direct phone number. Select your topic of interest from our six core offerings, and include a brief description of your team size or specific physical strain concerns. Tomas Lindqvist reviews all incoming submissions promptly to connect you with the appropriate clinician, whether you need ergonomist Kenji Arai or physiotherapist Ines Moreau.',
	'kcd6397b9' => 'Kenji Arai',
	'kce8ae9da' => 'Email',
	'kd0194726' => 'Director\'s Note from Dr. Helena Varga',
	'kd0298989' => 'Sat 08:30–12:30',
	'kd1cdfae3' => 'Every assessment follows our four-step clinical pathway: Talk, Look, Visit, and Plan. Step 1 begins with a 20-minute medical and occupational history discussing symptoms and routines. In Step 2, clinicians evaluate active movement and posture, focusing specifically on the shoulder, lower back, and wrist. In Step 3, we examine the workstation either on site or through detailed photographs and video. Finally, Step 4 delivers a tailored written plan to the worker and employer within 3 working days.',
	'kd22c0076' => 'Back on full shifts in week seven.',
	'kd2549549' => 'Naru Clinic',
